umber of visitors find their way here each year. A quick glance at the city centre makes it obvious why. Haarlem boasts a magnificent old centre with plenty of monumental buildings. As the city was home to several first class Dutch painters, including Frans Hals, there's a lot of art to go around. And if you're into shopping, a day in Haarlem is a day well spent too, as it was best shopping city of the country several times.","grounding":[{"source":"wikivoyage","title":"Haarlem","url":"https://en.wikivoyage.org/wiki/Haarlem","licence":"CC BY-SA 4.0"}],"short":"Haarlem is a compact historic city in the Netherlands, with the sea at Zandvoort aan Zee just west. The Frans Hals Museum and Teylersmuseum are the reasons to linger, and Het Dolhuys adds a quieter hour. June to August is the time to come.","short_src":"rewrite","facts":{"population":162543,"visit_h":9.6}},"highlights":[{"id":"hl-zandvoort-aan-zee","name":"Zandvoort aan Zee","kind":"Landmark","lat":52.37572,"lon":4.53146,"dist_km":7.9,"sig":2.483,"rank_score":11.29,"resolved_by":"retyped","image":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f0/ZandvoortAerialAPR2018-1.jpg/960px-ZandvoortAerialAPR2018-1.jpg","author":"Milliped","licence":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licence_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:ZandvoortAerialAPR2018-1.jpg","ok_print":true},"wikipedia":"https://nl.wikipedia.org/wiki/Zandvoort","heritage":true},{"id":"hl-frans-hals-museum","name":"Frans Hals Museum","kind":"Museum","lat":52.37661,"lon":4.63369,"dist_km":1.5,"sig":2.95,"rank_score":10.56,"resolved_by":"catalogue","fact":"Art museum in the Netherlands","image":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e3/Frans_Hals_Museum_portal_in_Haarlem.jpg/960px-Frans_Hals_Museum_portal_in_Haarlem.jpg","author":"This Photo was taken by Wolfgang Moroder. Feel free to use my photos, but please mention me as the author and send...","licence":"CC BY-SA 4.0","